#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm-based-notch.rst:6
#: 7cab1f44d3d84161b7576f6a71fac25e
msgid "RPM Sensor Based Dynamic Notch Setup"
msgstr "基于RPM传感器的动态陷波滤波器设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm-based-notch.rst:8
#: f49cada0c2704a1087a27ceee8534b95
msgid "Setup an :ref:`RPM sensor<common-rpm>`."
msgstr "设置 :ref:`RPM传感器<common-rpm>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm-based-notch.rst:9
#: 33973eda5cc5476a8822d4b2c7c1bb09
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_MODE "
"<INS_HNTC2_MODE>` = 2 or 5 to use an RPM sensor to set the harmonic notch "
"frequency."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_MODE <INS_HNTCH_MODE>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_MODE "
"<INS_HNTC2_MODE>` 设置为2或5，以使用RPM传感器设置谐波陷波滤波器的频率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm-based-notch.rst:10
#: 2eb3fd4d54ef4ef39035ce5de2dc44e7
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_ENABLE <INS_HNTCH_ENABLE>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_ENABLE"
" <INS_HNTC2_ENABLE>` = 1 to enable the harmonic notch"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_ENABLE <INS_HNTCH_ENABLE>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_ENABLE "
"<INS_HNTC2_ENABLE>` 设置为1以启用谐波陷波滤波器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm-based-notch.rst:11
#: e1a9f3b6094f4c7e97348b2af82811af
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_REF "
"<INS_HNTC2_REF>` = 1 to set the harmonic notch reference value to unscaled, "
"unless the RPM sensor is reporting a fraction of the actual rotor speed. "
"This might occur in a geared drive train setup. If the reported RPM is 1/3 "
"the actual, for example, set this to 0.33."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_REF <INS_HNTCH_REF>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_REF "
"<INS_HNTC2_REF>` "
"设置为1，将谐波陷波参考值设为未缩放，除非RPM传感器报告的是实际转子速度的分数值。这可能发生在齿轮传动系统中。例如，若报告的RPM为实际值的1/3，则将此参数设为0.33。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm-based-notch.rst:12
#: 99467eb70700449bb25ee61204ead3da
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ "
"<INS_HNTC2_FREQ>` = below the hover frequency.  In the RPM based dynamic "
"notch, this parameter sets the lower frequency limit of the notch.  So even "
"if the RPM sensor reads a lower value, the notch's center frequency will "
"remained constrainded to the value of this parameter.  You can easily "
"determine the hover frequency by performing a hover and looking at the RPM "
"sensor log data (e.g. RPM.rpm1)."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_FREQ <INS_HNTCH_FREQ>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_FREQ "
"<INS_HNTC2_FREQ>` "
"设置为低于悬停频率的值。在基于RPM的动态陷波模式中，该参数设定陷波滤波器的频率下限。因此，即使RPM传感器读取的值更低，陷波滤波器的中心频率也将限制在该参数值。您可以通过悬停飞行并查看RPM传感器日志数据（如RPM.rpm1）来确定悬停频率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm-based-notch.rst:13
#: d5c58fec46444ab5904de3afda387ed3
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`INS_HNTCH_BW <INS_HNTCH_BW>` and/or :ref:`INS_HNTC2_BW "
"<INS_HNTC2_BW>` = half of INS_HNTCH_FREQ"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`INS_HNTCH_BW <INS_HNTCH_BW>` 和/或 :ref:`INS_HNTC2_BW <INS_HNTC2_BW>` "
"设置为INS_HNTCH_FREQ的一半。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm-based-notch.rst:16
#: 351d991b576e4c8f9a96197459d099b6
msgid "Checking Harmonic Notch Effectiveness"
msgstr "检验谐波陷波滤波器效果"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm-based-notch.rst:17
#: 69fa9c7c20da460695acf6b49259ae28
msgid ""
"Check the performance of the filter(s) after setup by doing another post "
"filter configuration test flight as discussed in the :ref:`common-imu-"
"batchsampling` or :ref:`common-raw-imu-logging` page for this and analyze "
"the logs."
msgstr ""
"设置完成后，按照 :ref:`common-imu-batchsampling` 或 :ref:`common-raw-imu-logging` "
"页面中所述，进行滤波器配置后的测试飞行，并分析日志，以检验滤波器的性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm-based-notch.rst:20
#: 8cc4435a4dda43b795417d0164b54fd2
msgid ""
"While the log analysis of noise frequencies is not absolutely required prior"
" to notch setup for RPM based mode, the logging and analysis done for the "
"Confirmation flight using that method can be done in order to confirm the "
"noise elimination, if desired."
msgstr ""
"尽管在基于RPM模式的陷波滤波器设置之前不是绝对需要进行噪声频率日志分析，但如有需要，可在确认飞行中通过该方法进行记录和分析，以验证噪声消除效果。"
